  "target_stage": "timing",
  "operator": "timing_scale",
  "params": {
    "speed_cap": 3.0
  },
  "rationale": "Place failures (not_released_and_settled_at_goal) are the most frequent error (26/60 trials) and often occur at high commanded speed factors (>4). The timing oracle alone improves success by ~11.7 pp, indicating that reducing execution speed mitigates placement errors. Capping the speed factor at 3.0 aligns with the range of successful trials and should reduce overshoot/settling issues without overly slowing the robot."
}
